WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Scape - The Precipice of Betrayal, urgent.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not again!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Lyra: There! The shard!

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Kael: This place... it remembers.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Almost...

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Volatile Memory Chamber - The Treaty's Echo, dread.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.800 align:center
Lyra: Get back! Damn you!

8
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.100 align:center
Lyra: Hold still, shard!

9
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.400 align:center
Kael: Trust... a fragile thing.

10
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.700 align:center
Lyra: Yes! The path! Go!

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth of Shifting Alliances - The First Treachery, tense.

12
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.300 align:center
Lyra: It's moving. The walls shift.

13
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.600 align:center
Lyra: This isn't random. It's... planned.

14
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.900 align:center
Kael: They turn against you.

15
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.200 align:center
Lyra: A trap. I know it.

16
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Labyrinth - The Shattered Bridge, dread.

17
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.800 align:center
Lyra: Bridge is going! Move!

18
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.100 align:center
Kael: The paths... they lie.

19
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.400 align:center
Lyra: What paths? Kael, speak!

20
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.700 align:center
Lyra: Too late! Jump!

21
00:00:58.1000 --> 00:01:04.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - The Forked Path of Lies, tense.

22
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.300 align:center
Lyra: Which way? Traps everywhere.

23
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.600 align:center
Lyra: Hound! Get off me!

24
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.900 align:center
Kael: Not the easy one.

25
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.200 align:center
Lyra: Easy one? This one!

26
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:21.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - The Echo Chamber of Resilience, desperate.

27
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.800 align:center
Lyra: It's collapsing! Trapped!

28
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.100 align:center
Lyra: Resilience... show them!

29
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.400 align:center
Lyra: That's how you fight!

30
00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:27.700 align:center
Lyra: Move! Now!

31
00:01:28.1000 --> 00:01:34.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - The Gallery of Preserved Lies, dread.

32
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.300 align:center
Lyra: What is this? My memories?

33
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.600 align:center
Lyra: Twisted... all of it.

34
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.900 align:center
Kael: They keep what they take.

35
00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.200 align:center
Lyra: This isn't preservation. It's mockery.

36
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:51.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - The Gauntlet of Fading Resolve, tense.

37
00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.800 align:center
Lyra: Another trap! It never ends.

38
00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.100 align:center
Lyra: My resolve... it's thinning.

39
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.400 align:center
Kael: Hold on. Don't let go.

40
00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.700 align:center
Lyra: Can't... stop...

41
00:02:00.1000 --> 00:02:05.1000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth Core - The Altar of Betrayed Trust, desperate.

42
00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.300 align:center
Lyra: You again. No more running.

43
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.600 align:center
Lyra: That orb... it's mine!

44
00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.900 align:center
Kael: The truth... it hurts most.

45
00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.200 align:center
Lyra: Give it up!

46
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth Core - The Impossible Choice, dread.

47
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.800 align:center
Lyra: No! It's cracking!

48
00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.100 align:center
Lyra: Kael's memory... it's unstable.

49
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.400 align:center
Kael: My failure... it's done.

50
00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.700 align:center
Lyra: But... my trust. No!

51
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.000 align:center
Lyra: I'm sorry, Kael.

52
00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.300 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth Core - The Devastating Cost, horrified.

53
00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.600 align:center
Lyra: It's gone. He's gone.

54
00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.900 align:center
Silence: A worthy sacrifice. For *her*.

55
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.200 align:center
Lyra: Her? Who... no!

56
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.500 align:center
Silence: We know where you go next.
